{"ID":"20240205153629-asjzqxv","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153629-asjzqxv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153629-asjzqxv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110910-r9g5dij\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164728-z8svz1c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110910-r9g5dij\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:388,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:388\u0026#125;","title":"227羚羊角","type":"doc","updated":"20240821144930"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206110910-r9g5dij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110910-r9g5dij","updated":"20240206110916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于新疆、西藏、青海、内蒙古等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈长圆锥形，略呈弓形弯曲，长1533cm，类白色或黄白色，基部稍呈青灰色。嫩枝对光透视有“血丝”或紫黑色斑纹，光润如玉，无裂纹，老枝则有细纵裂纹。除尖端部分外，有1016个隆起环脊，间距约2cm，用手握之，四指正好嵌入凹处。角的基部横截面圆形，直径34cm，内有坚硬质重的“骨塞”，骨塞长约占全角的1/2或1/3，表面有突起的纵棱与其外面角鞘内的凹沟紧密嵌合，从横断面观，其结合部呈锯齿状。除去“骨塞”后，角的下半段成空洞，全角呈半透明，对光透视，上半段中央有一条隐约可辨的细孔道直通角尖。质坚硬。气无，味淡。羚羊角镑片：横片为类圆形薄片。类白色或黄白色，半透明，外表可见纹丝，微呈波状，中央可见空洞。质坚韧，不易拉断。气微，味淡。羚羊角纵片：为纵向条状薄片，类白色或黄白色，表面光滑，半透明，有光泽。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240206110920-ve0vn4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110920-ve0vn4q"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】\t咸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240206110922-r7y3vbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110922-r7y3vbf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】\t平肝息风，清肝明目，散血解毒。用于高热惊痫，神昏痉厥，子痫抽搐，癫痫发狂，头痛眩晕，目赤翳障，温毒发斑，痈肿疮毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240206110925-zargnlz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110925-zargnlz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炙品】\t羚羊角粉：为乳白色的细粉，气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240206110923-fh2iwq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110923-fh2iwq0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注解】\t“无影纹”：指羚羊角的尖部，质嫩者可透见红色血丝或紫黑色斑纹，无裂纹。“骨塞”：指羚羊角基部内坚硬而质重的角柱。“通天眼”：指羚羊角上部无角塞，中空，对光透视，上半段可见一条细孔道直通角尖。“水波纹”：指羚羊角基部，有1020个隆起的波状环脊，握之合把，有舒适感，由称合手。\n【附注】\t赛加羚羊 (Saiga tatarica) 在《世界自然保护联盟濒危物种红色名录》被列为极危物种。另外，它已被列入《濒危野生动植物种国际贸易公约》 (CITES) 附录二中。该物种不能进行商业目的野生标本贸易。"}]},{"ID":"20240206110910-lcqnkf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110910-lcqnkf9","updated":"20240206110910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206110910-egh7mwe.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205164728-z8svz1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205164728-z8svz1c","updated":"20240205164728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"羚羊角"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/羚羊角-20240205164728-w1dkob9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240626171126-g104ipe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626171126-g104ipe","updated":"20240821144230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 532px;","style":"width: 522px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"羚羊角"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/羚羊角-20240626171126-3xikxwo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 522px;\" parent-style=\"width: 532px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 683px;","style":"width: 673px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"羚羊角2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/羚羊角2-20240626171153-tr8wa7b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 673px;\" parent-style=\"width: 683px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821144315-4vitme2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821144315-4vitme2","updated":"20240821144605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 378px;","style":"width: 368px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"羚羊"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/羚羊-20240821144315-xe75rmj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 368px;\" parent-style=\"width: 378px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 841px;","style":"width: 831px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"羚羊 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/羚羊 1-20240821144605-ls8v9iy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 831px;\" parent-style=\"width: 841px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626170601-yvp600p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626170601-yvp600p","updated":"20240821144349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 848px;","style":"width: 838px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"羚羊角5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/羚羊角5-20240626171344-z5e04nr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 838px;\" parent-style=\"width: 848px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 334px;","style":"width: 324px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"羚羊角4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/羚羊角4-20240626171418-j1e95nu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 324px;\" parent-style=\"width: 334px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612114633-p3awn2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114633-p3awn2w","updated":"20240821144930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 385px;","style":"width: 375px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"羚羊 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/羚羊 2-20240821144829-ntgl5tc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 375px;\" parent-style=\"width: 385px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 825px;","style":"width: 815px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"羚羊 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/羚羊 3-20240821144930-9qjoviy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 815px;\" parent-style=\"width: 825px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612114412-ct3s9ho","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114412-ct3s9ho"}},{"ID":"20240612114438-bkw4pjr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114438-bkw4pjr","updated":"20240612114442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114438-ff9z7co","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114438-ff9z7co","updated":"20240612114438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114438-r7vj0oi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114438-r7vj0oi","updated":"20240612114438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主明目，益气起阴，去恶血注下，辟蛊毒恶鬼不祥，安心气，常不厌寐。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114438-guh95jk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114438-guh95jk","updated":"20240612114438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生石城及华阴山，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114438-ie136c8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114438-ie136c8","updated":"20240612114438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：羚大羊而细角。《广雅》云：美皮冷角。《尔雅》云：羚大羊。郭璞云：羚羊似羊而大，角园锐，好在山崖间。陶宏景云：《尔雅》名羱羊。据《说文》云：苋山羊细角也。《尔雅》云：羱如羊。郭璞云：羱似吴羊而大角，角椭，出西方，苋即羱正字，然本经羚字，实羚字俗写，当以羚为是《尔雅》释文，引本草作羚。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114413-kw51n2y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114413-kw51n2y"}},{"ID":"20240612114426-vmj6boh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114426-vmj6boh","updated":"20240612114429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114426-q75if73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114426-q75if73","updated":"20240612114426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泻心、肝火"}]},{"ID":"20240612114426-72nnh9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114426-72nnh9x","updated":"20240612114426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦咸微寒。羊属火，而羚羊属木，入足厥阴（肝）、手太阴、少阴（肺、心）经。目为肝窍，此能清肝，故明目去障。肝主风，其合在筋，此能祛风舒筋，故治惊痫搐搦，骨痛筋挛；肝藏魂，心主神明，此能泻心、肝邪热，故治狂越僻谬，梦魇惊骇；肝主血，此能散血，故治瘀滞恶血，血痢肿毒；相火寄于肝胆，在志为怒，（经曰∶大怒则形气绝，而血菀于上），此能下气降火，故治伤寒伏热，烦懑气逆，食噎不通；羚之性灵，而精在角，故又辟邪而解诸毒（昂按∶痘科多用以清肝火，而《本草》不言治痘）。似羊而大，角有节、最坚劲、能碎金刚石与貘骨（貘，音麦，能食铁）。夜宿防患，以角挂树而栖（角有挂纹者真。一边有节而疏，乃山驴、山羊，非羚也）。多两角。一角者胜。锉研极细，或磨用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114413-15zx50m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114413-15zx50m"}},{"ID":"20240612114414-zt43s04","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114414-zt43s04","updated":"20240612114419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114414-m4oqvuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114414-m4oqvuq","updated":"20240612114414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」九尾羊"}]},{"ID":"20240612114414-36y423a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114414-36y423a","updated":"20240612114414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」羚羊角：咸、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114414-f43u5oo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114414-f43u5oo","updated":"20240612114414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612114414-j0h3k86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114414-j0h3k86","updated":"20240612114414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、噎塞不通。用羚羊角屑研为细末，水送服一匙。同时以角摩擦噎塞部位。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114414-ze35o9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114414-ze35o9q","updated":"20240612114414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、胸胁痛满。用羚羊角烧为末，水送服一匙。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114414-cs1oeso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114414-cs1oeso","updated":"20240612114414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、腹痛热满。治方同上。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114414-d8d70lw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114414-d8d70lw","updated":"20240612114414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、堕胎腹痛，血出不止。用羚羊角烧灰，取三钱，豆淋酒送服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114414-4txyb0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114414-4txyb0e","updated":"20240612114414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、遍身赤丹。用羚羊角烧灰，鸡蛋清调匀涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114310-o7r9fnm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114310-o7r9fnm"}},{"ID":"20240612114401-d15at6p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114401-d15at6p","updated":"20240612114408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114401-lky7wsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114401-lky7wsd","updated":"20240612114401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸．入足厥阴经．功专散风清热．得钩藤息肝风．得生熟地茵陈芩枳枇杷石斛甘草二冬桂苓名甘露饮．治胃中湿热．然临症时宜酌．一角者胜．或研或磨用．能碎金钢石．"}]},{"ID":"20240612114310-by1s9s4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114310-by1s9s4"}},{"ID":"20240612114352-biwye0x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114352-biwye0x","updated":"20240612114356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《玉楸药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114352-xo3bpjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114352-xo3bpjv","updated":"20240612114352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、咸、微寒，入足厥阴肝经。清风明目，泻热舒筋。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114352-mtqmiv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114352-mtqmiv5","updated":"20240612114352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角清散肝火，治心神惊悸，筋脉挛缩，去翳明目，破瘀行血，消瘰疬毒肿，山水瘴疠。平肝，治胀满，除腹胁疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114330-nevjo5q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114330-nevjo5q"}},{"ID":"20240612114343-lfh9dqd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114343-lfh9dqd","updated":"20240612114347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114343-e56k8yw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114343-e56k8yw","updated":"20240612114343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今皆取有挂痕者。陈藏器∶取耳边听之，集集鸣者良，亦强出此说，未尝遍试也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114343-nfx5c11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114343-nfx5c11","updated":"20240612114343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今将他角附耳，皆集集有声，不如有挂痕一说尽矣。然多伪为之，不可不察。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114330-ldeodgu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114330-ldeodgu"}},{"ID":"20240612114331-ijv40bf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114331-ijv40bf","updated":"20240612114338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114331-3ckxsvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114331-3ckxsvw","updated":"20240612114331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清肝胆之热狂．性禀轻灵．咸寒解毒．治厥阴之风痉．功专明目．辟恶除邪．（羚羊角．诸羊属火．而羚羊属木．故独入肝胆．羚之性灵．其角又为清灵之物．故亦能解毒辟邪．咸寒之品．专清肝胆之火．凡一切目病惊痫肝风肝火诸病．因肝胆之火而成者．皆可用之．其余透发痘疹等类．亦与犀角相同．）"}]},{"ID":"20240612114320-e4qsiwy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114320-e4qsiwy"}},{"ID":"20240612114321-urari09","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114321-urari09","updated":"20240612114325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114321-rvxwxie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114321-rvxwxie","updated":"20240612114321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦咸。性寒。无毒。降也。阳中阴也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114321-rk4h126","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114321-rk4h126","updated":"20240612114321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主明目。益气。起阴。去恶血注下。辟蛊毒恶鬼不祥。安心气。常不魇寐。（本经）不通【归经】入心肝肺三经。为散邪清热之品。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114321-8ilta5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114321-8ilta5i","updated":"20240612114321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【前论】好古曰。今痘科多用以清肝火。而本草不言。缺略也。庵曰。目为肝窍。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114321-tmu4y8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114321-tmu4y8a","updated":"20240612114321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此能魂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114321-sujmaor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114321-sujmaor","updated":"20240612114321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血血通。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114321-t829239","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114321-t829239","updated":"20240612114321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【禁忌】经疏曰。心肝二经。虚而有热者宜。若虚而无热。忌用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114310-6xly4lg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114310-6xly4lg"}},{"ID":"20240612114311-mimwe1u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114311-mimwe1u","updated":"20240612114316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《本草害利》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114311-2y2sf29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114311-2y2sf29","updated":"20240612114311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔害〕性寒，能伐生生之气，凡肝心二经有热者，宜之。无火热勿用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114311-4qw8rtg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114311-4qw8rtg","updated":"20240612114311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔利〕苦咸，泻心肝肺邪热，下气降火，解毒散血，祛风舒筋。故能明目去障，治惊痫搐搦，亦治狂越僻谬梦魇，伤寒，伏热，气逆食噎不通。羚之性灵而精在角，故又辟邪，散瘀血而疗痘疮，解诸毒也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114311-iy83s3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114311-iy83s3b","updated":"20240612114311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕出西地，似羊而大，角有节，最坚劲，能碎金石，明亮而不黑者良，多两角，一角者更胜。镑片绵包，或磨汁用，入丸散须要不拆原对，绳缚，铁锉锉细，捣筛更研万遍入药，免刮人肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114239-a0l0k7w","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114239-a0l0k7w"}},{"ID":"20240612114302-cm9esii","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114302-cm9esii","updated":"20240612114305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114302-7clbeea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114302-7clbeea","updated":"20240612114302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"泻心肝火．"}]},{"ID":"20240612114302-e45jhy2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114302-e45jhy2","updated":"20240612114302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦咸寒．羊属火．而羚羊属木．入足厥阴．（肝．）手太阴、少阴经．（肺、心．）目为肝窍．"}]},{"ID":"20240612114302-rn3p33w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114302-rn3p33w","updated":"20240612114302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清肝．故明目去障．肝主风．其合在筋．祛风舒筋．故治惊痫搐搦．骨痛筋挛．肝藏魂．心主神明．泻心肝邪热．故治狂越僻谬．梦魇惊骇．肝主血．散血．故治瘀滞恶血．血痢肿毒．相火寄于肝胆．在志为怒．（经曰∶大怒则形气绝、而血菀于上．）下气降火．故治伤寒伏热．烦满气逆．食噎不通．羚之性灵．而精在角．故又辟邪而解诸毒．（今痘科多用以清肝火．）性寒．能伐生生之气．无火热勿用．出西地．似羊而大．角有节．最坚劲．能碎金刚石与貘骨．（貘音麦、能食铁．）夜宿防患．以角挂树而栖．（角有挂纹者真、一边有节而疏、乃山驴山羊、非羚也．）明亮而尖不黑者良．多两角．一角者更胜．锉研极细．或磨用．"}]},{"ID":"20240612114239-6zp6gbh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114239-6zp6gbh"}},{"ID":"20240612114252-10pvn7u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114252-10pvn7u","updated":"20240612114256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114252-of4z0gt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114252-of4z0gt","updated":"20240612114252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角味苦咸寒，主伤寒热清肺肝，痛风毒痢皆能止，又消食噎辟邪干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114252-fizm553","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114252-fizm553","updated":"20240612114252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚，聆也，耳边听之有声，然他角亦有声，但取角节蹙圆绕挛中深锐，紧小有挂痕者真。无毒。入足厥阴经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114252-rzbzitn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114252-rzbzitn","updated":"20240612114252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主伤寒时气寒热，热在肌肤。清肺能止热毒下痢血痢，清肝能治风毒伏骨疼痛蜷挛。古法为末，酒调服之，催产难；烧灰服之，治产后血冲心烦，又治食噎不通。雷公云∶角有神，能辟蛊毒梦魇惊狂，小儿惊痫，山岚瘴气，故又曰 羊，言有神灵也。入药勿令单用，须要不拆原对，以绳缚定，锉为末，勿令犯风，研极细入药，免刮人肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114239-kiglrfl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114239-kiglrfl"}},{"ID":"20240612114240-2jaip34","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114240-2jaip34","updated":"20240612114247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114240-7k61cj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114240-7k61cj3","updated":"20240612114240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、苦，寒、微寒，无毒。主明目，益气，起阴，去恶血注下，辟蛊毒恶鬼不祥，安心气，常不魇寐，疗伤寒，时气寒热，热在肌肤，温风注毒伏在骨间，除郁，惊梦，狂越，僻谬，及食噎不通。久服强筋骨，轻身，起阴，益气，利丈夫。生石城山川谷及华阴山，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114240-pv5z0uk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114240-pv5z0uk","updated":"20240612114240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今出建平宜都诸蛮中及西域，多两角者，一角者为胜。角甚多节，蹙蹙圆绕。别有山羊角极长，唯一边有节，节亦疏大，不入方用。而《尔雅》云名 羊，而羌夷云只此即名零羊，甚能陟峻 ；短角者，乃是山羊耳，亦未详其正。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114240-c7rj8x7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114240-c7rj8x7","updated":"20240612114240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕《尔雅》云∶羚，大羊，羊如牛大，其角堪为鞍桥，一名 羊，俗名山羊，或名野羊，善斗至死。又有山驴，大如鹿，皮堪靴用，有两角，角大小如山羊角，前言其一边有蹙文，又疏慢者是此也，陶不识谓之山羊误矣。二种并不入药，而俗人亦用山驴角者，今用细如人指，长四、五寸，蹙文细者，南山商浙间大有，梁州、龙州、直州、洋州亦贡之，古来相承用此，不用羚羊角，未知孰是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114212-idl1x7s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114212-idl1x7s"}},{"ID":"20240612114224-nw0qtzr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114224-nw0qtzr","updated":"20240612114228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《本草经解》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114224-h8oari6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114224-h8oari6","updated":"20240612114224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气寒．味咸．无毒．主明目．益气．起阴．去恶血注下．辟蛊毒．恶水不祥．常不魇寐．"}]},{"ID":"20240612114224-5xcfvgb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114224-5xcfvgb","updated":"20240612114224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角气寒．禀天冬寒之水气．入足少阴肾经．味咸无毒．得地北方之水味．入足太阳寒水膀胱经．气味俱降．阴也．膀胱经起于目内 ．气寒可以清火．火清则水足而目明矣．益气者．咸寒益肾气之不足也．起阴者咸寒益肾．肾足则宗筋强也．味咸则破血．气寒则清热．故主恶血注下也．蛊毒．湿热之毒也．咸寒可清湿热．所以主之．羚羊性灵通神．故辟恶鬼不祥．咸寒益肾．肾水足．则精明．所以常不魇寐也．"}]},{"ID":"20240612114224-u8leys7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114224-u8leys7","updated":"20240612114224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【制方】"}]},{"ID":"20240612114224-k8z5p9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114224-k8z5p9h","updated":"20240612114224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角同犀角、丹砂、牛黄、琥珀、天竺黄、金箔、茯神、远志、竹沥、钩藤．治癫狂．同杞子、甘菊、谷精、生地、五味、女贞子、黄柏．治肝热目翳．"}]},{"ID":"20240612114212-k6076mh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114212-k6076mh"}},{"ID":"20240612114213-ba0v3x1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114213-ba0v3x1","updated":"20240612114218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《本草择要纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114213-kfsgweu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114213-kfsgweu","updated":"20240612114213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（凡用有神羊角甚长．有二十四节．内有天生木胎．此角有神力抵下牛．凡使不可单用．须要不折元对．绳缚．铁锉锉细．重重密裹避风．以旋旋取用．捣筛极细．更研万匝入药．免刮人肠．）"}]},{"ID":"20240612114213-7c5f2uj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114213-7c5f2uj","updated":"20240612114213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240612114213-2ougwyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114213-2ougwyg","updated":"20240612114213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸寒无毒．"}]},{"ID":"20240612114213-qy5lmq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114213-qy5lmq7","updated":"20240612114213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240612114213-9czpfeu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114213-9czpfeu","updated":"20240612114213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"明目益气．起阴．去恶血注下．辟蛊毒恶鬼不祥．常不魇寐．除邪气惊梦狂越僻谬．疗伤寒时气寒热热在肌肤．湿风注毒伏在骨间．及食噎不通．久服强筋骨轻身．起阴益气．治中风筋挛附骨疼痛．作末蜜服．治卒热闷及热毒痢血疝气．摩水涂肿毒．治一切热毒风攻注．中恶毒风卒死．昏乱不识人．散产后恶血冲心烦闷．烧末酒服之．治小儿惊痫．治山瘴及噎塞．治惊悸烦闷．心胸恶气．瘰 恶疮溪毒．平肝舒筋．定风安魂．散血下气．辟恶解毒．治子痫痉疾．盖羊火畜也．而羚羊则属木．故其角入厥阴肝经甚捷．同气相求也．肝主木．开窍于目．其发病也．目暗障翳．而羚羊角能平之．肝主风．在合为筋．其发病也．小儿惊痫．妇人子痫．大人中风．搐搦及筋脉挛急历节掣痛．而羚角能舒之．魂者肝之神也．发病则惊骇不宁．狂越僻谬．魇寐卒使．而羚角能安之．血者肝之藏也．发病则瘀滞下注．疝痛毒痢．疮肿 ．产后血气．而羚羊能散之．相火寄于肝胆．在气为怒．病则烦懑气逆噎塞不通．寒热及伤寒伏热．而羚角能降之．羚之性灵．而筋骨之精在角．故又能辟邪恶而解诸毒．本经别录甚着其功．而近俗罕能发扬．惜哉．"}]},{"ID":"20240612114539-ta1n6jx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114539-ta1n6jx"}},{"ID":"20240612114540-pngfypa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114540-pngfypa","updated":"20240612114545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊角《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114540-y3pvng7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114540-y3pvng7","updated":"20240612114540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即羚羊角"}]},{"ID":"20240612114540-8b24sk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114540-8b24sk9","updated":"20240612114540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸寒无毒。镑碎胸前煨热令脆，研如粉，不则黏人肠胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114540-h6fh0kx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114540-h6fh0kx","updated":"20240612114540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主明目，益气起阴，去恶血注下，辟蛊毒恶鬼，不祥魇寐。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114540-lmi96m2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114540-lmi96m2","updated":"20240612114540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊属木，入厥足阴，伐肝最捷。目暗翳障，而羚羊角能平之。痘疮正面稠密不能起发，而羚羊能分之。小儿惊痫，妇人子痫，大人中风搐搦及筋寒历节痛，而羚羊角能舒之。惊骇不宁，狂越魇寐，而羚羊角能安之。恶鬼不祥，而羚羊角能辟之。恶血注下蛊毒疝痛，疮肿 ，产后血气，而羚羊角能散之。湿热留滞，阳气不振，阴气衰痿，而羚羊角能起之。烦惫气逆，噎塞不通，郁为寒热，而羚羊角能降之。详《本经》所主皆取散厥阴血结耳。愚按诸角皆能入肝散血解毒，而犀角为之首推，以其专食百草之毒，兼走阳明，力能祛之外出也。故痘疮之血热毒盛者，为之必需。若痘疮之毒并在气分，而正面稠密不能起发者，又须羚羊角以分解其势，使恶血流于他处，此非犀角之所能也。人但知羚羊角能消目翳，定惊痫而散痘疮恶血之功，人所共昧。羚羊角治青盲目暗与羚羊角不殊，而辟除邪魅蛊毒亦相仿佛，惜乎从未之闻。惟消乳癖《丹方》用之。白羯羊角亦能消乳癖，而方家每用琉璃角灯磁盘刮取薄屑，置胸中候脆，杵细，酒服方寸匙屡效，专取宿腐之味，以消陈积之垢也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114540-mthdybu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114540-mthdybu","updated":"20240612114540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其鹿角刮屑善消虚人乳肿，未溃即消，已溃即敛，即《本经》主漏下恶血之治。龙角治神魂不宁，功用与龙齿略同。《千金方》中有齿角并用者。牛角腮专主闭血、血崩，牛之一身惟此无用。而《本经》特为采录，《千金》尤为崩漏要药，可见天地间无弃物也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114522-3outai6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114522-3outai6"}},{"ID":"20240612114523-uz0nxxh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114523-uz0nxxh","updated":"20240612114530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114523-nbu6zei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114523-nbu6zei","updated":"20240612114526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"羚羊角"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，出石城山谷及华阴山，今秦、陇、龙、蜀、金、商州山中皆有之。戎人多捕得来货，其形似羊也，青而大。其角长一、二尺，有节如人手指握痕，又至坚劲，今人药者，皆用此角。谨按《尔雅》云∶ （与羚同），大羊。 （音元），如羊。郭璞注云∶ 似羊而大，角圆锐，好在山崖间。 似吴羊而大角，角椭，出西方。许慎注《说文解字》云∶ ，大羊而细角。陶隐居以角多节，蹙蹙圆绕者为羚羊，而角极长，唯一边有节，节亦疏大者，为山羊。山羊即《尔雅》所谓 羊也。唐注以一边有蹙文，又疏慢者，为山驴角。云时人亦用之。又以细如人指，长四、五寸，蹙文细者，为堪用。陈藏器云∶羚羊夜宿，以角挂木不着地，但取角弯中深锐紧小，犹有挂痕者是。观今市货者，与《尔雅》所谓 羊，陶注所谓山羊，唐注所谓山驴，大都相似。今人相承用之，以为 羊，其细角长四、五寸，如人指，多节蹙蹙圆绕者，其间往往弯中有磨角成痕处，京师极多，详本草及诸家所出，此乃是真 羊，而世多不用，不知其所以然者何也？又陈藏器谓真角，耳边听之，集集鸣者良。今牛、羊诸角，但杀之者，听之皆有声，不必专羚角也，自死角则无声矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114118-7wan2yz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114118-7wan2yz"}},{"ID":"20240612114156-bjmq82q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114156-bjmq82q","updated":"20240612114205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《证类本草》羚羊角"}]},{"ID":"20240612114156-84t57jo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114156-84t57jo","updated":"20240612114156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、苦，寒、微寒，无毒。主明目，益气，起阴，去恶血注下，辟蛊毒恶鬼不祥，安心气，常不魇寐，疗伤寒，时气寒热，热在肌肤，温风注毒伏在骨间，除邪气惊梦，狂越僻谬及食噎不通。久服强筋骨，轻身，起阴，益气，利丈夫。生石城山川谷及华阴山，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114156-q5lycjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114156-q5lycjn","updated":"20240612114156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶今出建平、宜都诸蛮中及西域。多两角，一角者为胜。角甚多节，蹙蹙园绕。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114156-hel4rq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114156-hel4rq0","updated":"20240612114156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别有山羊角长极长，唯一边有节，节亦疏大，不入药用。《尔雅》名 羊，而羌夷云∶只此名羚羊角，甚能陟峻。短角者乃是山羊尔。亦未详其正。唐本注云∶《尔雅》云∶羚，大羊。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114156-3aj027y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114156-3aj027y","updated":"20240612114156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊如牛大，其角堪为鞍桥。一名 羊，俗名山羊，或名野羊。善斗至死。又有山驴，大如鹿，皮堪靴用，有两角，角大小如山羊角。前言其一边有蹙文又疏慢者是此也。陶不识，谓山羊，误矣。二种并不入药。而俗人亦用山驴角者。今用细如人指，长四、五寸，蹙纹细者。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114156-t5aixk8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114156-t5aixk8","updated":"20240612114156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"南山、商、浙间大有，今出梁州、直州、洋州亦贡之。今按陈藏器本草云∶羚羊角，主溪毒及惊悸，烦闷，卧不安，心胸间恶气毒，瘰 。肉，主蛇咬，恶疮。山羊、山驴、羚羊，三种相似，医工所用，但信市人，遂令汤丸或致乖舛。且羚羊角有神，夜宿取角挂树不着地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114156-jntxaea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114156-jntxaea","updated":"20240612114156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但取角弯中深锐紧小，犹有挂痕者即是真，慢无痕者非，作此分别，余无它异。真角，耳边听之集集鸣者良。陶云一角者，谬也。臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶羚羊角，臣，味甘。能治一切热毒风攻注，中恶毒风，卒死昏乱不识人，散产后血冲心烦闷，烧末酒服之。主小儿惊痫，治山瘴，能散恶血。烧灰治噎塞不通。孟诜云∶羚羊，北人多食，南人食之，免为蛇虫所伤。和五味子炒之，投酒中经宿，饮之治筋骨急强，中风。又角，主中风筋挛，附骨疼痛，生摩和水涂肿上及恶疮，良。又卒热闷，屑作末，研和少蜜服。亦治热毒痢及血痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114156-f72l2rs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114156-f72l2rs","updated":"20240612114156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶羚羊角，出石城山谷及华阴山，今秦、陇、龙、蜀、金、商州山中皆有之。戎人多捕得来货，其形似羊也，青而大，其角长一、二尺，有节如人手指握痕，又至坚劲。今入药者皆用此角。谨按《尔雅》云∶羚，大羊。 （音元），如羊。郭璞注云∶羚，似羊而大，角圆锐，好在山崖间； 似吴羊而大角，角椭，出西方。许慎注《说文解字》云∶羚，大羊而细角。陶隐居以角多节，蹙蹙圆绕者为羚羊；而角极长，唯一边有节，节亦疏大者为山羊。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114156-x0fjq7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114156-x0fjq7y","updated":"20240612114156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"山羊，即《尔雅》所谓 羊也。唐注以一边有蹙文又疏慢者为山驴角，云时人亦用之。又以细如人指，长四、五寸，蹙纹细者为堪用。陈藏器云∶羚羊夜宿以角桂木不着地，但取角弯中深锐紧小，犹有挂痕者是。观今市货者，与《尔雅》所谓 羊，陶注所谓山羊，唐注所谓山驴，大都相似。今人相承用之，以为 羊其细角长四、五寸，如人指多节蹙蹙园绕者，其间往往弯中有磨角成痕处，京师极多，详本草及诸家所出，此乃是真 羊，而世多不用，不知其所以然者何也？又陈藏器谓∶真角，耳边听之集集鸣者良。今牛羊诸角，但杀之者听之皆有声，不必专羚角也，自死角则无声矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114156-zn429bi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114156-zn429bi","updated":"20240612114156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公凡所用亦有神羊角。其神羊角长有二十四节，内有天生木胎。此角有神力，可抵千牛之力也。凡修事之时，勿令单用，不复有验，须要不拆原对，以绳缚之，将铁错子错之，旋旋取用，勿令犯风，错未尽处，须三重纸裹，恐力散也。错得了即单捣，捣尽，背风头，重筛过，然入药中用之，若更研万匝了，用之更妙，免刮人肠也。食疗伤寒热毒，下血，末服之即瘥。又疗疝气。外台秘要治噎。羚羊角屑不拘多少自在末之，饮服方寸匕，亦可以角摩噎上，良。千金方∶疗产后心闷不识人，汗出。羚羊角烧末，以东流水服方寸匕，未瘥再服。肘后方∶血气逆心烦满。烧羚羊角若水羊角末，水服方寸匕。子母秘录∶治胸胁痛及腹痛热满。烧羚羊角末，水服方寸匕。又方∶治小儿洞下痢。羊角中骨烧末，饮服方寸匕。产宝令易产。羚羊角一枚，刮尖为末，以酒调方寸匕。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114156-q30flx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114156-q30flx7","updated":"20240612114156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶羚羊角，今皆取有挂痕者。陈藏器取耳边听之集集鸣者良。亦强出此说，未尝遍试也。今将他角附耳，皆集集有声，不如有挂痕一说尽矣。然多伪为之，不可不察也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114127-68rugt8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114127-68rugt8"}},{"ID":"20240612114146-b8s9yij","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114146-b8s9yij","updated":"20240612114150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《本草蒙筌》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114146-tc2kbpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114146-tc2kbpy","updated":"20240612114146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、苦，气寒。无毒。形类羊色青颇大，角多节劲锐犹长。（甚坚，劲长一二尺，节密蹙蹙旋绕。）种生川蜀山林，夜宿角挂树上。猎犬追捕，亦多获之。虏人常以货钱，州郡亦每克贡。入药拯病，锯角取尖。认弯蹙处，有挂痕深入者才真；听人耳边，似响声微出者尤妙。（如节疏无挂痕者，听无声者，并山羊、山驴角亦往往摩成痕迹欺人谋利，不可不察。）或捣末少加蜜服，或错屑共投水煎。专走肝经，因性属木。尝加紫雪，（仲景伤寒方名。）为味苦寒。解伤寒寒热，在于肌肤；散温风注毒，伏于骨肉。安心气，除魇寐惊梦狂越；泽邪气，辟蛊毒恶鬼不祥。退小儿卒热发搐惊痫，驱产妇败血冲心烦闷。去恶血注下，治食噎不通。明目益气轻身，强阴健筋坚骨。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和五味子同炒投酒，能逐中风证筋骨急强。南人食之，免致蛇啮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114127-pnnufx4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114127-pnnufx4"}},{"ID":"20240612114137-qo8xn4t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114137-qo8xn4t","updated":"20240612114141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114137-fpkkgld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114137-fpkkgld","updated":"20240612114137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角，味咸、苦，气寒，无毒。专走肝经。解伤寒寒热在肌肤，散温风注毒伏于骨内，安心气，除魇寐惊梦狂越，辟邪气，祛恶鬼。小儿惊痫，产妇败血，皆能治之。此物亦备用，以待变者也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114137-wumk3kg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114137-wumk3kg","updated":"20240612114137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角，不可轻用之药，宜于治实症，而不宜于治虚症。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114137-mnqyfgf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114137-mnqyfgf","updated":"20240612114137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问羚羊角，别本载久服强筋骨，轻身，起阴益气，利丈夫，似乎为强阳助气之品。缪仲醇谓∶火热则阴反不能起，而筋骨软。咸寒入下焦，除邪热，则阴自起，气自益，筋骨强，身轻也。仲醇之言，未尝非是，然而羚羊角实不能补虚。仲醇亦因《本草》载有利益之语，故曲为解之云，久服强筋骨轻身，起阳益气，入下焦除热，则阴自起，气自益，筋骨强。实治邪而不补正气，不可误也。终不可据之，以望其滋补也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114127-6eb8zmd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114127-6eb8zmd"}},{"ID":"20240612114128-fyadol3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114128-fyadol3","updated":"20240612114132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《神农本草经读》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114128-ppce4s3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114128-ppce4s3","updated":"20240612114128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味咸、寒，无毒。主明目，益气，起阴，去恶血，注下。辟蛊毒，恶鬼不祥，常不魇寐。（俗称羚羊）【参】羚羊角气寒味咸无毒，入肾与膀胱二经。主明目者，咸寒以补水，水足则目明也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114128-tu8qj9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114128-tu8qj9v","updated":"20240612114128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"益气者，水能化气也。起阴者，阴器为宗筋而属于肝，肝为木，木得烈日而萎，得雨露而挺也。味咸则破血，故主去恶血。气寒则清热，故止注下也。蛊毒为湿热之毒也，咸寒可以除之。辟恶鬼不祥、常不魇寐梦者，夸其灵异通神之妙也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612114118-sh61pg8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612114118-sh61pg8"}},{"ID":"20240612114119-8u41ffa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114119-8u41ffa","updated":"20240612114123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114119-x5qic3x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114119-x5qic3x","updated":"20240612114119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦咸寒，属木入肝肺心，清肝祛风，泻邪热，散血下气解毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113841-emy7aew","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612113841-emy7aew"}},{"ID":"20240612114106-coewd45","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612114106-coewd45","updated":"20240612114112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240612114106-kmpgtsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114106-kmpgtsv","updated":"20240612114106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（兽）专泻肝火兼清心肺"}]},{"ID":"20240612114106-6c7dg9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612114106-6c7dg9f","updated":"20240612114106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角（专入肝。兼入心肺）。苦咸大寒。功专入肝。兼入心肺二经。考书所论主治。多属冗统。惟李时珍剖晰甚明。言羊火畜也。而羚羊则属木。故其角入厥阴肝经甚捷。同气相求也。肝主木。开窍于目。其发病也。目暗障翳。而羚羊角能平之。肝主风。在合为筋。其发病也。小儿惊痫。妇人子痫。大人中气搐搦。及筋脉挛急。历节掣痛。而羚羊角能舒之。魂者肝之神也。发病则惊骇下宁。狂越僻谬。魇寐卒死。而羚羊角能安之。血者肝之脏也。发病则瘀滞下注。疝痛毒痢。疮肿瘰 。产后血气。而羚羊角能散之。相火寄于肝胆。在气为怒。病则烦懑气逆。噎塞不通。寒热及伤寒伏热。而羚羊角能降之。羚之性灵。而筋骨之精在角。故又能辟恶而解诸毒。碎佛牙而烧烟。走蛇虺也。本经别录甚着其功。而近俗罕能发扬。惜哉！时珍之论如此。但此虽能清肝及肺。若使过用久用。则更有伐生之气耳。多两角。一角者胜。（若一边有节而疏。乃山驴山羊。非羚羊也。）锉研极细。或磨用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113841-18rzzo4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612113841-18rzzo4"}},{"ID":"20240612113853-ze0mtzc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-ze0mtzc","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：羚羊角"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-gkjeayb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-gkjeayb","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-fn0nwuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-fn0nwuu","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Línɡ Yánɡ Jiǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-jrqhnf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-jrqhnf8","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-fnkssiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-fnkssiz","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 高鼻羚羊"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-2kfchvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-2kfchvs","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-gd52ok2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-gd52ok2","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" CORNU SAIGAE TATARICAE"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-jvhwawc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-jvhwawc","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-hkwa0b7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-hkwa0b7","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为牛科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"赛加羚羊"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Saiga tatarica Linnaeus的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"角"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。猎取后锯取其角，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-e8qa89k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-e8qa89k","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-tbpld1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-tbpld1h","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品呈长圆锥形，略呈弓形弯曲，长15～33cm，类白色或黄白色，基部稍呈青灰色。嫩枝对光透视有“血丝”或紫黑色斑纹，光润如玉，无裂纹，老枝则有细纵裂纹。除尖端部分外，有10～16个隆起环脊，间距约2cm,用手握之，四指正好嵌入凹处。角的基部横截面圆形，直径3～4cm，内有坚硬质重的角柱，习称“骨塞”，骨塞长约占全角的1/2或1/3,表面有突起的纵棱与其外面角鞘内的凹沟紧密嵌合，从横断面观，其结合部呈锯齿状。除去“骨塞”后，角的下半段成空洞，全角呈半透明，对光透视，上半段中央有一条隐约可辨的细孔道直通角尖，习称“通天眼”。质坚硬。气无，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-u0fe32j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-u0fe32j","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-405vl8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-405vl8b","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置阴凉干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-j77kijl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-j77kijl","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-i02izv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-i02izv5","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"羚羊角镑片"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取羚羊角，置温水中浸泡，捞出，镑片，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-e89dqw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-e89dqw2","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"羚羊角粉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取羚羊角，砸碎，粉碎成细粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-biqzkq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-biqzkq5","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-sn22g61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-sn22g61","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品横切面：可见组织构造多少呈波浪状起伏。角顶部组织波浪起伏最为明显，在峰部往往有束存在，束多呈三角形；角中部稍呈波浪状，束多呈双凸透镜形；角质部波浪形不明显，束呈椭圆形至类圆形。髓腔的大小不一，长径10～50（80）μm,以角基部的髓腔最大。束的皮层细胞扁棱形，3～5层。束间距离较宽广，充满着近等径性多边形、长菱形或狭长形的基本角质细胞。皮层细胞或基本角质细胞均显无色透明，其中不含或仅含少量细小浅灰色色素颗粒，细胞中央往往可见一个折旋旋旋旋光性强的圆粒或线状物。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-0sttfoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-0sttfoa","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-vh67zqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-vh67zqk","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝、心经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-lmz30md","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-lmz30md","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-83ct7jw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-83ct7jw","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-izrrzgm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-izrrzgm","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-f50oxq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-f50oxq5","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 平肝息风，清肝明目，散血解毒。用于高热惊痫，神昏痉厥，子痫抽搐，癫痫发狂，头痛眩晕，目赤翳障，温毒发斑，痈肿疮毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-2t7z98u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-2t7z98u","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-60kolne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-60kolne","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1～3g，宜单煎2小时以上；磨汁或研粉服，每次0.3～0.6g。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-30nm817","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-30nm817","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-zitku0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-zitku0r","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-p6ytjc5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-p6ytjc5","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：羚羊角"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-6jsndwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-6jsndwz","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-kwcrw86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-kwcrw86","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Línɡ Yánɡ Jiǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-a0xl18a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-a0xl18a","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-tcjv2dl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-tcjv2dl","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-n7ibnbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-n7ibnbn","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-jwaloug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-jwaloug","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为牛科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"赛加羚羊"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"角"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。全年均可捕捉，捕得后，将角从基部锯下。一般以8～10月猎取者色泽最好。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-76wlwlk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-76wlwlk","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-va5ixl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-va5ixl8","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主要栖于半沙漠地区。夏季大多居于空旷的荒漠地带，晚秋至冬季则在盐沼半荒漠地带。群栖。分布新疆等地。产于新疆。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-3d5zxgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-3d5zxgx","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-7p18rve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-7p18rve","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 赛加羚羊，又名：高鼻羚羊。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-liwhqnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-liwhqnn","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体形中等.身长1～1.4米。肩高雄兽为70～83厘米，雌兽为63～74厘米。体重雄兽为37～60公斤，雌兽为29～37公斤。头大。鼻吻膨大，鼻孔亦大，且能灵活伸缩和左右摆动。额前部分较隆突。眼大。耳短。四肢细小，蹄低而长。尾细短，下垂。雌兽有乳头4对。夏毛短而密，紧贴皮肤。全身呈棕黄色或栗色，脸面部较淡，背脊中央有狭长的一条呈肉桂色；颈下方、胸腹部及四肢内侧几呈白色。雄兽具角，长于眼眶之上，向后微倾。角基部为棕黄色，上部黄白色如蜡，表面约有20个轮脊，角上部至尖端处光滑无轮脊。雌兽无角，仅有短的突起。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-3wfq4uv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-3wfq4uv","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-yo71ug6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-yo71ug6","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 完整的角呈长圆锥形，略呈弓形弯曲，长25～40厘米，基部直径约3厘米，白色或黄白色。除尖端部分外，有10～20个隆起的轮脊，幼枝较少。尖部光圆，弯锥形，光润如玉，嫩枝透视有血丝或呈紫黑色，无裂纹，质老的有纵裂纹，无黑尖。角基部圆形，有骨塞，名\"羚羊塞\"，约占全长的一半或三分之一。骨塞圆形，坚硬而重，表面有凸出的顺纹与角内面合槽，颇坚固，自横截面上视之，其接合处呈不规则的锯齿状。将骨塞除去后，角之下半段为简形，中空，有细孔直通尖上，习称\"通天眼\"，近光可透视，为羚羊角的主要鉴别特征。质坚硬。无臭，味淡。以质嫩、色白、光润、有血丝、无裂纹者为佳。质老、色黄白、有裂纹者质次。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-iqtvj10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-iqtvj10","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毒性"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-yrn1zgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-yrn1zgz","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 按每日2克/公斤给予小鼠7天，体重增长缓慢，而饮食、排便、自由活动等方面无明显改变。毒性很低。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-kqearkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-kqearkh","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-av0jqyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-av0jqyp","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含磷酸钙、角蛋白及不溶性无机盐等，其中角蛋白含量最多。羚羊角的角蛋白含硫只有1.2％，是角蛋白中含硫最少者之一。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-tgk7vv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-tgk7vv7","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-0du9qy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-0du9qy3","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①对中枢的作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-s17gcvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-s17gcvr","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角外皮浸出液（以50％醇作成100％流浸膏，实验前蒸去乙醇）能降低小鼠朝向性运动反应，对中枢神经系统有抑制作用，可加速巴比妥及乙醚麻醉之开始速度，显着降低对五甲烯四氮唑、士的宁、电休克的敏感性，却不导致肌肉松弛；煎剂能降低咖啡因所致蟾蜍及小鼠的惊厥率，并增高恢复率，但对士的宁所致惊厥则无效，亦不能增强苯巴比妥钠对蟾蜍及小鼠的毒性。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-xmoanzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-xmoanzp","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②解热作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-cfugv06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-cfugv06","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角煎剂对伤寒、副伤寒甲乙三联菌苗引起发热的家兔有解热作用，灌胃后2小时体温开始下降，6小时后逐渐恢复。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-mqhsq0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-mqhsq0f","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③其他作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-efp2di8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-efp2di8","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羚羊角外皮浸出液，能增加动物对缺氧的耐受能力，有镇痛作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-86ldic5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-86ldic5","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-hzqskpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-hzqskpf","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 羚羊角片：除去骨塞，入水中浸渍后，捞出去筋，镑成纵向薄片，晾干。羚羊角粉：除去骨塞，锉碎，研成细粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-kmhouyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-kmhouyz","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-oeilv56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-oeilv56","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝、心经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-u5rhzk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-u5rhzk5","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草蒙筌）：\"走肝经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-ehkiu65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-ehkiu65","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"入手太阴、少阴，足厥阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-5p9u35r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-5p9u35r","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-zsliumy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-zsliumy","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-zno69mh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-zno69mh","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味咸，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-0xza612","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-0xza612","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"苦，微寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-3xx6u44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-3xx6u44","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"味甘。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-io669n8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-io669n8","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-zablkme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-zablkme","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 平肝熄风，清热镇惊，解毒。治热病神昏痉默，谵语发狂；头痛眩晕，惊痫搐搦，目赤翳膜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-b9z5o2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-b9z5o2f","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主明目，益气起阴，去恶血注下，安心气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-lkojj1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-lkojj1x","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗伤寒时气寒热，热在肌肤，温风注毒伏在骨间，除邪气惊梦，狂越僻谬，及食噎不通。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-2rgy5s3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-2rgy5s3","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"能治一切热毒风攻注，中恶毒风卒死，昏乱不识人；散产后血冲心烦闷，烧末酒服之；主小儿惊痫，治山瘴，能散恶血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-bc8m874","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-bc8m874","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④孟诜：\"主中风筋挛，附骨疼痛，生摩和水涂肿上及恶疮；又卒热闷，屑作末，研和少蜜服；亦治热毒痢及血痢。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-lyukn9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-lyukn9a","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《食疗本草》：\"伤寒热毒下血，末服之。又疗疝气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-ogfgcr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-ogfgcr7","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草拾遗》：\"主溪毒及惊悸，烦闷，卧不安，心胸间恶气毒，瘰疬。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-k4qdorp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-k4qdorp","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《纲目》：\"平肝舒筋，定风安魂，散血下气，辟恶解毒，治子痫痉疾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-9uw76on","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-9uw76on","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《本草再新》：\"定心神，止盗汗，消水肿，去瘀血，生新血，降火下气，止渴除烦。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-qyywx5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-qyywx5l","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-swykeco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-swykeco","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：磨汁，3～5分；煎汤，0.5～1钱；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-f9raam9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-f9raam9","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-d2f5c7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-d2f5c7p","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治伤寒时气，寒热伏热，汗、吐、下后余热不退，或心惊狂动，烦乱不宁，或谵语无伦，人情颠倒，脉仍数急，迁延不愈：羚羊角磨汁半盏，以甘草、灯芯各一钱，煎汤和服。（《方脉正宗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-u65aszp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-u65aszp","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治中风手颤，亸曳语涩：羚羊角（镑）一两，犀角（镑）三分，羌活（去芦头）、防风（去叉）各一两半，薏苡仁（炒）、秦艽（洗）各二两。共研细末，炼蜜丸，如梧桐子大。每服二十丸，煎竹叶汤下，渐加至三十丸。（《圣济总录》羚羊角丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-ncroevn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-ncroevn","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治偏风，手足不随，四肢顽痹：羚羊角（镑）一两，独活（去芦头）二两，乌头（炮裂，去皮、脐）三分，防风（去叉）一分。锉如麻豆。每服五钱匕，以水二盏，煎取一盏，去滓，分温二服，空腹、夜卧各一。（《圣济总录》羚羊角汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-plcemf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-plcemf7","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治阳厥气逆、多怒：羚羊角、人参各三两，赤茯苓二两（去皮），远志（去心）、大黄（炒）各半两，甘草一分（炙）。上为末。每服三钱，水一盏半，煎至八分，去滓温服，不计时候。（《宣明论方》羚羊角汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-cu8jc2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-cu8jc2n","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治血虚筋脉挛急，或历节掣痛：羚羊角磨汁半盏，以金银花一两五钱，煎汤一碗，和服。（《续青囊方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-gbn598r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-gbn598r","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治产后中风，身体反张如角弓：羚羊角屑三分，独活一两，当归三分（锉，微炒），防风一两（去芦头），人参半两（去芦头），赤芍药半两，细辛半两，桂心半两，麻黄一两（去根、节）。捣，粗罗为末。每服四钱，以水一中盏，入生姜半分，煎至六分，去滓，不计时候温服。（羚羊角散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-qv9v7ah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-qv9v7ah","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治小儿夜啼及多惊热：羚羊角屑一分，黄芩一分，犀角屑一分，甘草一分（炙微赤，锉），茯神一分，麦门冬半两（去心，焙）。捣，粗罗为散。每服一钱，以水一小盏，煎至五分，去滓，量儿大小，分减服之。（羚羊角散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-pwlrf85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-pwlrf85","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治时气七日，心神烦热，胸膈不利，目赤，不得睡卧：羚羊角屑、黄芩、柱子仁、黄连（去须）、川升麻、枳壳（麸炒微黄，去瓤）各一两。捣罗为末，炼蜜和丸，如梧桐子大。每服不计时候，以竹叶汤下三十丸。（羚羊角丸，⑥方以下出《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-f0w8req","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-f0w8req","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治心肺风热冲目，生胬肉：羚羊角（镑）、黄芩（去黑心）、柴胡（去苗）、升麻各三分，甘草（生锉）一两。粗捣筛，每服五钱匕，水一盏半，煎至一盏，去滓，食后服。（《圣济总录》羚羊角汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-lnbryo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-lnbryo7","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治眼卒生白翳膜：羚羊角屑半两.泽泻半两，甘菊花一两，葳蕤半两，菟丝子半两（酒浸三日，曝干，别捣为末）。捣，粗罗为散，每服三钱，以水一中盏，煎至六分，去滓，不计时候，温服。（《圣惠方》羚羊角散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-zer6f1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-zer6f1h","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治痘唐后馀毒未清，随处痛肿：羚羊角磨汁半盏，以黄耆、金银花各二两，煎汤和服。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-mq4z44j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-mq4z44j","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-28x1fqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-28x1fqn","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"羚羊角，入厥阴肝经。肝开窍于目，其发病也，目暗障翳，而羚羊角能平之。肝主风，在合为筋，其发病也，小儿惊痫，妇人子痫，大人中风搐搦，及经脉挛急，历节掣痛，而羚羊角能舒之。魂者肝之神也，发病则惊骇不宁，狂越僻谬，而羚角能安之。血者肝之藏也，发病则瘀滞下注，疝痛毒痢，疮肿瘰疬，产后血气，而羚角能散之。相火寄于肝胆，在气为怒，病则烦懑气逆，噎塞不通，寒热，及伤寒伏热，而羚角能降之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-3dbepl9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-3dbepl9","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本经逢原》：\"诸角皆能入肝，散血解毒，而犀角为之首推，故痘疮之血热毒盛者，为之必需。若痘疮之毒，并在气分，而正面稠密，不能起发者，又须羚羊角以分解其势，使恶血流于他处，此非犀角之所能也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-5eoribi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-5eoribi","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-uo9fgyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-uo9fgyo","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-sr5jse0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-sr5jse0","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：羚羊角"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-sphqxl9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-sphqxl9","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-bf9nsq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-bf9nsq4","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Línɡ Yánɡ Jiǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-a6qx94n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-a6qx94n","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-a83q27v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-a83q27v","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 泠角"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-q9j3c0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-q9j3c0i","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-adwgcww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-adwgcww","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Antelope Horn"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-cxwvkan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-cxwvkan","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-85owhlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-85owhlh","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-2gdtn5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-2gdtn5c","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-fuhm5mm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-fuhm5mm","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为牛科动物赛加羚羊的角。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-83ihrsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-83ihrsx","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Saiga tatarica Linnaeus."}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-u85kon2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-u85kon2","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年均可捕捉，捕得后，将角从基部锯下。削成薄片，或磨成粉末备用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-yhdz9cq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-yhdz9cq","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-706b8qx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-706b8qx","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：栖息于荒漠及半荒漠的开阔地区，性喜干旱。以各种植物为食，如梭梭，蒿类、羽茅等。一般边食边行。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-dw5bagu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-dw5bagu","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：在我国仅分布于新疆北部的边境地区。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-3wj7gu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-3wj7gu6","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-uvid7k6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-uvid7k6","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 赛加羚羊，身体大小与黄羊相似，长1-1.4m，体重雄兽为37-60kg，雌兽约29-37kg。头型较特别，耳廓短小，眼眶突出。鼻端大，鼻中间具槽，鼻孔呈明显的筒状，整个鼻子呈肿胀鼓起，故谓高鼻羚羊。雄羊具角1对，不分叉，角自基部长出后几乎竖直向上，至生长到整个角的1/3高度时，二角略向外斜，接着又往上，往里靠近再又微微向外，最后二角相向略往内弯。角尖端平滑，而下半段具环棱。角呈半透明状，内蜡色。整个体色呈灰黄色，但体侧较灰白。冬季时毛色显得更淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-h9qcpow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-h9qcpow","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-0on0ait","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-0on0ait","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生活习性 赛加羚羊喜干燥，常栖息于荒漠及半荒漠的开阔地区及草原上。冬季为了避风雪，它们就迁往平缓的山间坡地或平原中过冬，夏季晨昏活动，冬季则转为白日活动。活动时一般成30-40只小群，也常见到100-200只以上的大群活动。奔跑时是跳跃式前进，轻捷如飞。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-kqcobua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-kqcobua","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"养殖技术 赛加羚羊1.5-2岁性成熟。每年12-2月发情交配。在发情期可按1雄：3-5雌群配种。雌羊一般怀孕141天左右产仔，每胎1-2仔。羊羔出生后，应尽快用纱布擦净其鼻孔和嘴里的羊水，并用5%碘酊消毒脐带外端，再用消毒棉线结扎。刚产下的羔羊毛色较深，2-3h就能直立行走。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-cmzaw80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-cmzaw80","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饲养管理 羊羔产下后30min，一般即会站起来主动去吃乳。若羊羔不会吃奶或母羊不给羊羔哺乳，可强行挤奶饲给羊羔、或用鲜山羊奶100ml，鲜鸡蛋10ml，鱼肝油5ml，白糖10g，食盐1g配成人工乳喂养，40-60d龄后断奶。羊羔9d龄左右开始随母羊学吃草，20d龄左右开始吃精料。青饲料可以苜蓿、红豆草为主，精饲料以玉米粉为主。注意设立水盆，自由饮水。羚羊胆小。易惊恐，故应防止噪音等各种因素惊扰。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-48hsmzz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-48hsmzz","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-cwis1hr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-cwis1hr","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 呈长圆锥形，略呈弓形弯曲，长15-33cm，类白色或黄白色，基部稍呈青灰色。嫩技透视有“血丝”或紫黑色斑纹，光滑如玉，无裂纹，老枝则有细纵裂纹。除尖端部分外，有11-16个隆起环脊，中部以下多呈半环，间距约2cm，用手握之，四指正好嵌入凹处。角的基部横截面圆形，直径3-4cm，内有坚硬质重的角柱，习称“骨塞”，骨塞长约占全角的1/2或1/3，表面有突起的纵棱与其外面用鞘内的凹沟紧密嵌合，从横断面观，其结合部呈锯齿状。除去骨塞后，角的下半段成空洞，全角呈半透明，对光透视，上半段中央有1条隐约可辨的的细孔道直通角尖，习称“通天眼”。质坚硬。气无，味淡， 以质嫩，色白，光润，有血丝裂纹者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-dosp5gg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-dosp5gg","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别羚羊角横切面可见组织构造多少呈波浪状起伏。角顶部组织波浪起伏最为明显，在峰部往往有末存在，束多呈三角形；用中部稍呈波浪状，束多至双凸透镜形；用基部波浪形不明显。束呈椭圆形至类圆形。髓腔的大小不一，长径10-50（-80）μm，以角基部的髓腔最大，束的皮层细胞扁梭形，3-5层。束间距离较宽广，充满着近等径性多边形、长菱形、或狭年形的基本角质细胞。皮层细胞或基本角质细胞均显无色透明，其中不含或仅含少量细小浅灰色色素颗粒，细胞中央往往可见一个折光性强的圆粒或线状物。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-q3y2vu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-q3y2vu5","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特征：淡灰白色。为不规则碎块，近白色、淡黄白色或淡灰色，微透明，均匀分布有多数长圆形、新月形、长条形空隙，偶见空隙周围显细密放射状纹理；有的碎块隐约可见长梭形纹理。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-emkid84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-emkid84","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毒性"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-1b115sa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-1b115sa","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 按每日2g／kg给予小鼠7天，体重增长缓慢，而饮食、排便、自由活动等方面无明显改变。毒性很低。小鼠静脉注射4%羚羊角水解液8ml／kg（相当于成人用量的100倍），给药后3小时内活动略有减少，余未见任何异常。小鼠灌胃10%羚羊角煎剂2g／kg,连续给药7天，除体重增长缓慢外，余未见明显改变。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-gn2pw5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-gn2pw5o","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-d6b6ich","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-d6b6ich","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 赛加羚羊角含角蛋(keratin)磷酸钙，不溶性无机盐，赖氨酸(lysine)，丝氨酸(serine)，谷氨酸(glutamic acid)，苯丙氨酸(phenylalanine)，亮氨酸(leucine)，天冬氨酸(aspartic acid)，酪氨酸(tyrosine)等17种氨基酸，并含五种磷脂类成分，即卵磷脂(lecithine)、脑磷脂(cephalin)、神经鞘磷脂(sphingomyelin)、磷脂酰丝氨酸(phosphatidylserine)、磷脂酰肌醇(phosphatidylinositol)等成分。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-llo3ti9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-llo3ti9","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-ap0ufb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-ap0ufb6","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.镇静和抗惊厥作用：羚羊角水煎液 腹腔注射10-20g（生药）／kg，可显着减少小鼠的自主活动，延长水合氯醛引起的小鼠睡眠时间，对抗苯丙胺的兴奋作用。腹腔注射羚羊角醇提液或注射液，也能使小鼠的自发活动减少。其外皮浸出液能降低小鼠朝向性运动反应，并可使巴比妥及乙醚麻醉的诱导期缩短。小鼠分别注射羚羊角醇提液10g／kg、水煎剂2g／kg和水解液80mg／kg，均能明显延长硫喷妥钠的睡眠时间，结果表明羚羊角水解后镇静作用大为增强，此外，10%羚羊角煎剂，每只蟾蜍淋巴囊注射0.1g，对吗啡因惊厥的发生率无明显降低，但恢复率显着增加。小鼠灌胃10g／kg，能显着降低咖啡因惊厥率、增加其恢复率，但抗士的宁惊厥的效果不明显，小鼠腹腔注射羚羊角注射液80mg／kg,则可对抗士的宁所致惊厥作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-c1tc30w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-c1tc30w","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.解热作用：给人工发热兔分别静脉注射羚羊角水煎剂和醇提液各2g／kg、水解液40mg／kg、注射液 800mg／kg，均有明显的解热作用。给人工发热兔灌胃羚羊角煎剂4g／kg，给药后2小时体温下降，6小时后逐渐恢复正常。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-llnj9v4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-llnj9v4","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.对循环系统的作用：羚羊角50%煎剂2ml/kg 静脉注射，使麻醉猫血压下降，切断两侧迷走神经后，降压作用有所减弱，说明降压反应可能与中枢神经有关。煎剂或醇提液小剂量使离体蟾蜍心脏收缩加强，中等剂量可致心传导阻滞，大剂量则引起心率减慢、振幅减小，最后心跳停止。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-s6zjp9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-s6zjp9d","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.其它作用：体外试验表明，羚羊角注射液对多种革兰氏阳性和阴性致病菌均无抑制作用。羚羊角外皮浸出液能增加小鼠对缺氧的耐受能力，并有镇痛作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-0fxnryj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-0fxnryj","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-2zl6war","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-2zl6war","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 羚羊角片：除去骨塞，入水中浸渍后，捞出去筋，镑成纵向薄片，晾干。羚羊角粉：除去骨塞，锉碎，研成细粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-i5dxn1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-i5dxn1f","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-y56p4ya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-y56p4ya","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别（1）取粉末0.2g，加氯仿10ml，冷浸48h滤过，滤液水浴浓缩至干，加适量氯仿溶解，取少量点于硅胶G薄层板上，以苯-乙酸乙酯（7：3）为展开剂，展距15cm，用硅钨酸试剂喷雾，100℃烘5min，在R10.51处有1斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-j01onen","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-j01onen","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取粉末0.2g，加乙醇10ml，放置12h，滤过，滤液在340-230um处扫描，吸收度量程O-1A，波长标尺放大20um/cm，在260土2nm、254土2nm、248土2nm。及 220士2nm波长处有最大吸收。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-jmicvbt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-jmicvbt","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-cu5b1ow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-cu5b1ow","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；心经"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-od9i67z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-od9i67z","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-o9gfx9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-o9gfx9h","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味咸；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-qgkupte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-qgkupte","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-ybdnyhh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-ybdnyhh","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 脾虚慢惊患者禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-sqf3y8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-sqf3y8k","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-jpcet96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-jpcet96","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 平肝息风；清肝明目；凉血解毒。主肝风内动惊痫抽搐；筋脉拘挛；肝阳头疼眩晕；肝火目赤肿痛以及血热出血；温病发斑；痈肿疮毒"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-jf3osg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-jf3osg5","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-mo1ru1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-mo1ru1r","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1.5-3g，宜单煎2h以上；磨汁或研末，0.3-0.6g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，煎汤或磨汁涂敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-hfjtoc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-hfjtoc9","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-svvazs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-svvazs9","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治伤寒时气，寒热伏热，汗、吐、下后余热不退，或心惊狂动，烦乱不宁，或谵语无伦，人情颠倒，脉仍数急，迁延不愈： 羚羊角磨汁半盏，以甘草、灯芯各一钱，煎汤和服。(《方脉正宗》)②治中风手颤，DE曳语涩： 羚羊角(镑)一两，犀角(镑)三分，羌活(去芦头)、防风(去叉)各一两半，薏苡仁(炒)、秦艽(洗)各二两。共研细末，炼蜜丸，如梧桐子大。每服二十丸，煎竹叶汤下，渐加至三十丸。(《圣济总录》羚羊角丸)③治偏风，手足不随，四肢顽痹： 羚羊角(镑)一两，独活(去芦头)二两，乌头(炮裂，去皮、脐)三分，防风(去叉)一分。锉如麻豆。每服五钱匕，以水二盏，煎取一盏，去滓，分温二服，空腹、夜卧各一。(《圣济总录》羚羊角汤)④治阳厥气逆、多怒： 羚羊角、人参各三两，赤茯苓二两(去皮)，远志(去心)、大黄(炒)各半两，甘草一分(炙)。上为末。每服三钱，水一盏半，煎至八分，去滓温服，不计时候。(《宣明论方》羚羊角汤)⑤治血虚筋脉挛急，或历节掣痛： 羚羊角磨汁半盏，以金银花一两五钱，煎汤一碗，和服。(《续青囊方》)⑥治产后中风，身体反张如角弓： 羚羊角屑三分，独活一两，当归三分(锉，微炒)，防风一两(去芦头)，人参半两(去芦头)，赤芍药半两，细辛半两，桂心半两，麻黄一两(去根、节)。捣，粗罗为末。每服四钱，以水一中盏，入生姜半分，煎至六分，去滓，不计时候温服。(羚羊角散)⑦治小儿夜啼及多惊热： 羚羊角屑一分，黄芩一分，犀角屑一分，甘草一分(炙微赤，锉)，茯神一分，麦门冬半两(去心，焙)。捣，粗罗为散。每服一钱，以水一小盏，煎至五分，去滓，量儿大小，分减服之。(羚羊角散)⑧治时气七日，心神烦热，胸脯不利，目赤，不得睡卧：羚羊角屑、黄芩、枝子仁、黄连(去须)、川升麻、枳壳(敖炒微黄，去瓤)各一两。捣罗为末，炼蜜和丸，如梧桐子大。每服不计时候，以竹叶汤下三十丸。(羚羊角丸，⑥方以下出《圣惠方》)⑨治心肺风热冲目，生胬肉：羚羊角(镑)、黄芩(去黑心)、柴胡(去苗)、升麻各三分，甘草(生锉)一两。粗捣筛，每服五钱匕，水一盏半，煎至一盏，去滓，食后服。(《圣济总录》羚羊角汤)⑩治眼卒生白翳膜： 羚羊角屑半两．泽泻半两，甘菊花一两，葳蕤半两，菟丝子半两(酒浸三日，曝干，别捣为末)。捣，粗罗为散，每服三钱，以水一中盏，煎至六分，去滓，不计时候，温服。《圣惠方》羚羊角散)(11)治痘后馀毒未清，随处痛肿： 羚羊角磨汁半盏，以黄耆、金银花各二两，煎汤和服。(《本草汇言》)"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-86ecknl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-86ecknl","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-7l06pvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-7l06pvv","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：羚羊角，入厥阴肝经。肝开窍于目，其发病也，目暗障翳，而羚羊角能平之。肝主风；在合为筋，其发病也，小儿惊痫，妇人子痫，大人中风搐搦，及经脉挛急，历节掣痛，而羚羊角能舒之。魂者肝之神也，发病则惊骇不宁，狂越僻谬，而羚角能安之。血者肝之藏也，发病则瘀滞下注，疝痛毒痢，疮肿瘰疬，产后血气，而羚角能散之。相火寄于肝胆，在气为怒，病则烦懑气逆，噎塞不通，寒热，及伤寒伏热，而羚角能降之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-ok6ozl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-ok6ozl7","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本经逢原》：诸角留能入肝，散血解毒，而犀角为之首推，故痘疮之血热毒盛者，为之必需。若痘疮之毒，并在气分，而正面稠密，不能起发者，又须羚羊角以分解其势，使恶血流于他处，此非犀角之所能也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-x8yjnka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-x8yjnka","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经》：主明目，益气起阴，去恶血注下，安心气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-kvv40d9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-kvv40d9","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《别录》：疗伤寒时气寒热，热在肌肤，温风注毒伏在骨间，除邪气惊梦，狂越僻谬，及食噎不通。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-l5r6jcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-l5r6jcb","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《药性论》：能治一切热毒风攻注，中恶毒风卒死，昏乱不识人；散产后血冲心烦闷，烧末酒服之；主小儿惊痫，治山瘴，能散恶血。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-clnupou","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-clnupou","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240612113853-4qftlbq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-4qftlbq","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240612113853-l1nggv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-l1nggv9","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孟诜：主中风筋挛，附骨疼痛，生摩和水涂肿上及恶疮；又卒热闷，屑作末，研和少蜜服；亦治热毒痢及血痢。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-iidi1za","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-iidi1za","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《食疗本草》：伤寒热毒下血，末服之。又疗疝气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-iiqjarw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-iiqjarw","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草拾遗》：主溪毒及惊悸，烦闷，卧不安，心胸间恶气毒，瘰疬。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-jkeqbzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-jkeqbzu","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《纲目》：平肝舒筋，定风安魂，散血下气，辟恶解毒，治子痫痉疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-bg6mz7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-bg6mz7k","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《本草再新》： 定心神，止盗汗，消水肿，去瘀血，生新血，降火下气，止渴除烦。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-bes2woc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-bes2woc","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612113853-ztn0qje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113853-ztn0qje","updated":"20240612113853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612113854-1kzwh9e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612113854-1kzwh9e"}},{"ID":"20240612113855-ja7hrft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113855-ja7hrft"}}]}